# 512 mW, 20 ps at 210 K. A moving restraint drives the smooth ice fraction.
units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data data.seed
mass 1 18.0154
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 2.0 bin
timestep 10.0
velocity all create 210.0 21 dist gaussian
fix pl all plumed plumedfile plumed.smooth outfile plumed.out
fix npt all npt temp 210.0 210.0 200.0 iso 1.0 1.0 2000.0
thermo 2000
run 2000
